WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.625
A compound is different atoms chemically joined in a fixed ratio.

2
00:00:05.376 --> 00:00:09.301
Hydrogen, oxygen and water molecules, mixed together.

3
00:00:11.201 --> 00:00:14.126
Hydrogen: one type of atom, an element.

4
00:00:16.172 --> 00:00:20.897
Water is always two hydrogens joined to one oxygen: a compound.
